msgstr "Polygon-Sicherheitsabstand"

#: main.py:3183
msgid ""
"Camera-captured polygons are shrunk by this many millimeters on every "
"edge before nesting. This safety margin compensates for camera "
"measurement error near the edges of its view — keeps pads from landing "
"where a chunk of leather might actually be missing.\n"
"\n"
"Typical: 2-5mm. Set to 0 to disable."
msgstr ""
"Mit der Kamera erfasste Polygone werden vor dem Nesten um diese "
"Millimeter pro Kante verkleinert. Dieser Sicherheitsabstand gleicht "
"Messfehler in Bildrandnähe aus — verhindert, dass Polster dort landen, wo"
" das Leder eventuell fehlt.\n"
"\n"
"Üblich: 2-5 mm. 0 zum Deaktivieren."

